0 FILE 10190 - Main model.ldr
0 Modular four-floor market building: ground floor with windows, staircase, balcony, lamppost and flower; first floor with door, windows, awnings and sign; second floor with door, windows, awnings, flagpost and balcony; third floor with turntable, lattice windows, sloped roof, balcony and chimney; plus an attached car port with arched gated entrance, lamp, flag and storage baskets
0 Name: 10190 - Main model.ldr
0 Author: Max Martin Richter [MMR1988]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
